From a personal point of view

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:14.750
I've always been interested in education

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.200
in the context of India,
because that's where I grew up.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.370
And I've been

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:22.170
it's something I was a
