learning and education

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:31.350
has been experienced also
differently in different places.

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:33.160
And countries are taking different parts.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.520
And so we're very aware of that.

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.060
We're working with places
we're working with say

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:40.500
like the Indonesian ministry to figure out

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.690
how we can deploy classroom

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:45.500
