00:21:46.350 --> 00:21:48.550
to ensure that we have...

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:53.210
We do build more models and so on

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:56.623
that don't reflect biases in society.

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:01.290
It's complex work that involves
both a research component

00:22:02.973 --> 00:22:05.427
as well as a deployment component.

00:22:05.427 --> 00:22:07.690
And a lot of work is happening on that

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:09.587
in many different areas.

00:22:09.587 --> 00:22:11.890
And so I think that's an area of concern

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:13.380
and it's an area that a lot of people

00:22:13.380 --> 00:22:15.333
are paying deep attention to.

00:22:16.540 --> 00:22:18.380
- Yeah, definitely.

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:21.900
So, as you think about your team

