- Yeah.

00:23:30.043 --> 00:23:32.840
The people are extremely passionate

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:37.810
about making researchers
lives more productive

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:40.430
having them get more access to papers

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.890
and all the sets of
things that make research

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:46.150
and the information needed for research,

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:48.340
more available and useful.

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:51.910
Google arts and culture
is trying to get...

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:55.300
Is getting a whole by working
with cultural institutes

00:23:55.300 --> 00:23:58.850
to make those sorts of experiences

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:00.750
