00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:16.440
So, in the area

00:24:17.330 --> 00:24:18.423
of education,

00:24:19.800 --> 00:24:22.350
I want to understand what teachers need.

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:24.180
In the area of scholar

00:24:24.180 --> 00:24:26.640
they are trying to understand
