00:24:35.040 --> 00:24:36.750
what people's needs are

00:24:36.750 --> 00:24:40.073
so that we can actually serve those needs.

00:24:42.238 --> 00:24:43.071
- That makes sense.

00:24:43.071 --> 00:24:48.071
So kind of looking for folks
that have that user-centric

00:24:48.570 --> 00:24:49.403
- Yes.

00:24:49.403 --> 00:24:51.600
- Or ideas that make sense.

00:24:51.600 --> 00:24:52.433
- Yes.

00:24:52.433 --> 00:24:54.280
And Google has this focus on the user

00:24:54.280 --> 00:24:55.270
and other things will follow.

00:24:55.270 --> 00:24:58.910
But and it's something that
